Hi<%= @user.first_name.present? ? " #{@user.first_name}" : "" %>,

You've been added as an admin of <%= @franchise.name %>. You'll sign in with:

<%= @user.email %>

First, choose your password. This link works once and expires in <%= @expires_in_days %> days:

